  <compounddef id="group__network__setters" kind="group">
    <compoundname>network_setters</compoundname>
    <title>Setters</title>
    <sectiondef kind="func">
      <memberdef kind="function" id="group__network__setters_1ga1aa3081179a1aedb081b59578eab0345" prot="public" static="no" const="no" explicit="no" inline="no" virt="non-virtual">
        <type>const int</type>
        <definition>const int ndxlSetNetworkParams</definition>
        <argsstring>(NDXLNetwork *_Network, void *_Params)</argsstring>
        <name>ndxlSetNetworkParams</name>
        <param>
          <type><ref refid="group__ndxl__objects_1gaefd105209efdd9f61bea4c3f76770d37" kindref="member">NDXLNetwork</ref> *</type>
          <declname>_Network</declname>
        </param>
        <param>
          <type>void *</type>
          <declname>_Params</declname>
        </param>
        <briefdescription>
<para>Sets the user-defined <computeroutput>void* _Params</computeroutput> of a network. </para>
        </briefdescription>
        <detaileddescription>
<para><parameterlist kind="param"><parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">_Network</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Target network to update the parameters of.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
<parameteritem>
<parameternamelist>
<parametername direction="in">_Params</parametername>
</parameternamelist>
<parameterdescription>
<para>Pointer to extra memory used by the network. May be NULL.</para>
</parameterdescription>
</parameteritem>
</parameterlist>
<simplesect kind="return"><para>If _Network is NULL, returns <ref refid="group__ndxl__err_1gae9261a8e1c9a6cebdc947ee5798cca1e" kindref="member">NDXL_ERR</ref>, otherwise updates the parameters of _Network, and returns NDXL_OK.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="warning"><para>NDXL stores the supplied <computeroutput>void* _Params</computeroutput> pointer without copying the associated data or managing its lifetime. The pointed-to memory must remain valid for as long as the network uses it.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="warning"><para>This function replaces the networks&apos;s existing parameter pointer without freeing or otherwise managing the memory it previously referenced. The user remains responsible for managing both the previous and new allocations.</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="par"><title>Errors raised</title><para><itemizedlist>
<listitem><para><ref refid="group__ndxl__err_1gaf6b8bdcb87bdd7944810152b510101e4" kindref="member">NDXL_ARG_ERR</ref> : _Network is NULL.</para>
</listitem></itemizedlist>
</para>
</simplesect>
<simplesect kind="see"><para><ref refid="group__network__getters_1ga995644f99e39725649115b8080f5f486" kindref="member">ndxlGetNetworkParams</ref> </para>
</simplesect>
</para>
